{
 "name": "Rest of Lumbridge step 7b: the ducks. Examine on a drake, a duck, the ducklings, the attackable duckling and the walking duck and drake (::keys on), a drake on the river out of reach, and a duck's death animation",
 "account": "test",
 "steps": [
  {
   "step": "waitForLogin"
  },
  {
   "step": "command",
